00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
B2.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:08,500
Toby is calling his mum to tell her about lunch at Sunshine Middle School.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:16,780
Listen to their conversation and complete the notes below. Hi, Mum.

4
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:25,040
Let me tell you about lunchtime here at Sunshine Middle School. It's amazing! Really?

5
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,850
What makes it amazing?

6
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:32,510
First of all, here we get an hour and a half for lunch.

7
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:40,810
So there's lots of time to eat a good lunch and then relax for a while before afternoon lessons.

8
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:47,200
The dining hall is great, and every day there are different dishes.

9
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,810
We can eat delicious hot food and stay healthy.

10
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:58,090
There are many meats and vegetables and different kinds of noodles.

11
00:00:58,090 --> 00:01:00,520
They taste really good.

12
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:07,050
And then I can try all kinds of local snacks. They're delicious!

13
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:10,900
And I know how to eat with chopsticks now.

14
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:15,370
Oh, we even get to watch movies after we eat.

15
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:19,420
It's a cool way to relax during lunchtime.

16
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:22,270
I'm glad to hear that.

17
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:23,980
Enjoy your time there!
